# Movie Party — build-time configuration (copy to .env; NEVER commit .env)
#
# TMDB shared key: baked into the app at build time as the DEFAULT key so
# every install (yours and your friend's) lights the Home hero out of the
# box. A key pasted in Settings → General always overrides it per device,
# so if this one stops working you can swap in a replacement at any time
# without a new build.
#
# Use EITHER your v3 API key (32 hex chars) OR your v4 read access token
# (long string starting with "eyJ"). Paste exactly one, as a single line.
VITE_TMDB_TOKEN=
